  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "vant Hoff factors for urea, NaCl, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> are 1, 2, 3 and 4 respectively. <br/>As <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> , so <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub></math> for urea, NaCl, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> are proportional to 1, 2, 3 and 4 respectively. Hence, freezing point order is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>&lt;</mo></math> Urea",
